---
// Testimonials Component
---

<section
  class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1117] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300 border-t border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-constival-mint/10 border border-constival-mint/20 mb-6"
      >
        <svg
          class="w-4 h-4 text-constival-mint"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
          ></path></svg
        >
        <span
          class="text-fine font-bold font-sans text-constival-navy dark:text-white uppercase tracking-widest"
          >Casos de Éxito</span
        >
      </div>
      <h2
        class="font-sans text-section-title font-black text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-6 tracking-tighter leading-none"
      >
        Estructuras probadas en el <br />
        <span class="text-constival-mint dark:text-constival-mint"
          >mundo real.</span
        >
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed md:leading-relaxed"
      >
        Empresarios que pasaron de la incertidumbre a tener un patrimonio
        corporativo blindado y 100% operativo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div
        class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#161b28] p-8 relative rounded-sm border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5"
      >
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-amber-400">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <p
          class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 italic"
        >
          "Nos salvaron de un congelamiento bancario por no renovar
          administradores a tiempo. Su monitoreo preventivo paga por sí solo el
          servicio."
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="w-12 h-12 bg-white dark:bg-white/10 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-sm"
          >
            <img
              src="/img/empresas/retail_ec.webp"
              alt="Retail EC"
              class="w-full h-full object-contain"
            />
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-sans font-bold text-fine text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
            >
              Javier P.
            </h3>
            <p
              class="font-sans text-fine text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400"
            >
              Fundador, Retail EC
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div
        class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#161b28] p-8 relative rounded-sm border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5"
      >
        <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-amber-400">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"
            ></path></svg
          >
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
